Do not stop at a proposal, a visual prototype, or a basic gesture demo.

The goal is a playable, polished portrait version of Alva that makes combat approachable to beginners while remaining faithful to the original game’s mechanics and control philosophy.

The experience should be intuitive enough that a new player can discover the controls through ordinary interaction with the screen, and precise enough that an experienced player can still execute deliberate movement, attacks, combos, and defensive maneuvers.
